      "prompt": "Solve 5^(x+2) = 625^(2x).",
      "solution_steps": [
        "Write both sides as powers of 5: 5 = 5^1 and 625 = 5^4",
        "5^(x+2) = 625^(2x) becomes 5^(x+2) = 5^(4×2x), i.e. 5^(x+2) = 5^(8x)",
