      "prompt": "Two fair six-sided dice are rolled. Find the probability that at least one die shows 6.",
      "solution_steps": [
        "P(neither die shows 6) = 5/6 × 5/6 = 25/36",
        "P(at least one 6) = 1 - 25/36 = 11/36"
      ],
      "final_answer": "11/36",
